{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0fe113e8fbc89317cb2770c437488b2a914be30db59a2e9a009bdeb8447bde6b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented skill discovery scans a brand group (kimi, then claude, then codex directories) and a generic group independently and merges the results, with same-named brand-group skills resolved kimi-over-claude-over-codex under a setting that defaults to merging every available brand directory."},{"claim_ids":["clm_abb71dd2bc5e119b629bacd09d899b3a160826f47ab1c7d5f40a154f31e05a2d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documentation distinguishes two Kimi Code CLI extension mechanisms: skills give knowledge-based guidance the AI reads via SKILL.md, while plugins declare executable tools through plugin.json that the AI can invoke directly."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0fe113e8fbc89317cb2770c437488b2a914be30db59a2e9a009bdeb8447bde6b","clm_abb71dd2bc5e119b629bacd09d899b3a160826f47ab1c7d5f40a154f31e05a2d"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:48:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_26e3f4a8703e4983bf19fad5e0382d40","id":"pg_c3e8bba4ea2b5dc4b0d0bc431238e461","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/moonshotai-kimi-cli-docs-en-customization-skills-md-86f136422a0a-bc431238e461.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c985537b7c12593997154486d92db000"],"title":"MoonshotAI/kimi-cli/docs/en/customization/skills.md @ 86f136422a0a","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:48:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26e3f4a8703e4983bf19fad5e0382d40"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_69af78d568cd66eb1f537fb2a366e29418d664e650884e8f65a376f75006dd9e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documentation states that if the working directory becomes inaccessible mid-session, Kimi Code CLI detects this, shows a crash report with the session ID and path, exits cleanly, and lets the session be resumed from the correct directory."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f069076df183e2ab68d9b97fc2917f08965a96a0352ad530fd72183259b7e4b8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documentation states a detected newer version shows a blocking update prompt before the shell loads, letting the user upgrade immediately, skip once, or skip and suppress future reminders for that version; this whole update check can be disabled with an environment variable."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f8648b5e8f4a3a2d7049619d0cfd930f059906763b7b456e9f51caf753cab9ac"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documentation states running cd in shell command mode does not change Kimi Code CLI's own working directory, because each shell command runs in an independent subprocess whose directory changes do not persist."}],"claim_ids":["clm_69af78d568cd66eb1f537fb2a366e29418d664e650884e8f65a376f75006dd9e","clm_f069076df183e2ab68d9b97fc2917f08965a96a0352ad530fd72183259b7e4b8","clm_f8648b5e8f4a3a2d7049619d0cfd930f059906763b7b456e9f51caf753cab9ac"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:48:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_26e3f4a8703e4983bf19fad5e0382d40","id":"pg_c950d4bd32fc522a9931fdf7175b677d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/moonshotai-kimi-cli-docs-en-faq-md-86f136422a0a-fdf7175b677d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_37b4747e250d5b10b2b4b9569d0a9793"],"title":"MoonshotAI/kimi-cli/docs/en/faq.md @ 86f136422a0a","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:48:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26e3f4a8703e4983bf19fad5e0382d40"}
